# Keep the build context small and secret-free. Build context is the repo root.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.husky
.claude
infra
brand
docs
seed
*.md
!apps/*/README.md

# Secrets: never enter an image
info.txt
secrets.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
